---
# /book, "Request a time" (overhaul v3, WS3, 2026-10-29). Layout: _includes/layouts/v3.njk.
# Art direction 3.7: Showroom Black, single column max 560px, H1 "Request a time.", the
# what-happens-next line above the form, the call route under it, no image. Wording:
# _data/pages/book.json. The form is the shared partial _includes/v3/request.njk (form name
# "quote"). Accepts ?b=<build code> and ?s=<car|home|blinds|chip|other>, applied by
# assets/v3/js/40-request.js. Promises only what is true: a person confirms the time, never a
# response time (owner question open; site.lines.request_confirm prints only when set).
layout: layouts/v3.njk
permalink: book.html
slug: book
page_key: book
mood: dark
header_raised: true
bundles: ["book"]
---
{%- from "v3/request.njk" import requestForm with context -%}
{%- from "v3/actions.njk" import action with context -%}
{%- set pg = pages.book -%}
<section class="section section--minor rq-page" aria-labelledby="rq-h1" data-section="request">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rq-col stack stack-32">
      <header class="stack stack-16">
        <h1 id="rq-h1">{{ pg.hero.heading | safe }}</h1>
        <p class="t-lead">{{ (pg.hero.lead if site.texts_confirmed === true else pg.hero.lead_calls_only) | replace("{phone}", '<span class="rq-nowrap">{phone}</span>') | rqFill(site) | safe }}{% if site.lines and site.lines.request_confirm %} {{ site.lines.request_confirm | safe }}{% endif %}</p>
      </header>
      {{ requestForm({ source: "book", id: "rq" }) }}
{#- Peak R2 (psychology N4): the build's price, restated beside the build it came with. The table
    holds only the shapes whose every piece passes the price gate in this build's mode
    (lib/eleventy-book-prices.js, the builder's own solver), so a production page carries no draft
    number; book/40-request-build.js reads it. -#}
      <script type="application/json" id="bc-build-prices">{{ pricing | bookBuildPrices(price_mode) | jsonld | replace("<", "\\u003c") | safe }}</script>
      <div class="rq-routes stack stack-12">
        <p class="t-body fg-2">{{ pg.routes.talk | rqFill(site) | safe }}</p>
        {{ action({ slot: "contact", service: "any", build: false, on_book: true }) }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
